OL,3,GNEWSATerminally ill mum who can't talk,
OL,4,Awalk or dress herself refused Pip
OL,5,Apayment
OL,6,
OL,7,FA terminally ill mum who has been given
OL,8,Fthree years to live has been denied
OL,9,Fdisability benefit despite being unable
OL,10,Fto eat, talk, dress or use the toilet
OL,11,Findependently.
OL,13,FRachael Field, 56, from Rhondda Cynon
OL,14,FTaf, who has tongue cancer, was first
OL,15,Fdiagnosed six years ago.
OL,17,FShe uses a feeding tube, has had her
OL,18,Ftongue and voice box removed, and had
OL,19,Fher windpipe reconstructed using chest
OL,20,Ftissue. Field also has mobility issues.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
