OL,3,GNEWSATerminally ill mum who can't talk,
OL,4,Awalk or dress herself refused Pip
OL,5,Apayment
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this year, she was denied
OL,8,FPersonal Independence Payment (Pip), to
OL,9,Fsupport people with disability-related
OL,10,Fextra costs.
